      "Initial access via phishing attachment invoice_q3_report.docm on WS-FINANCE-042.",
      "Process execution chain winword.exe -> powershell.exe -> injection into explorer.exe.",
      "Active C2 beaconing to external malicious IP 198.51.100.42 on port 443."
    ],
    "recommended_actions": [
      "Isolate host WS-FINANCE-042 from corporate network.",
      "Block C2 IP 198.51.100.42 across edge firewall and perimeter proxies.",
      "Revoke John Smith's Kerberos TGT and reset credentials.",
      "Scan all email inboxes for subject 'Urgent Invoice Q3'."
